# Unicode CLDR 47, locale be, cldr-dates-full/main/be/dateFields.json.
# The hour noun standing after the ordinal that names the hour: "другая
# гадзіна" (02:00), "а другой гадзіне" (at two).  Only the nominative and
# locative singular are listed -- the plural "дзве гадзіны" is a DURATION of
# two hours, not a clock reading, and listing it here would read one as the
# other.
гадзіна
гадзіне
